  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temperature Converter</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"convert\" class=\"pixel-btn\">Convert</button>\n    <div class=\"result-area\">\n      <span class=\"result-label\">Result:</span>\n      <output id=\"result\" class=\"result-value\">--</output>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"formulas\">\n      <p><strong>C → F:</strong> x × 9/5 + 32</p>\n      <p><strong>F → C:</strong> (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "*,\n*::before,\n*::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\n:root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card-bg: #16213e;\n  --primary: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --input-bg: #0f3460;\n  --border: #533483;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 480px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--primary);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  border-bottom: 3px solid var(--border);\n  padding-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\ninput,\nselect {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  background: var(--input-bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  outline: none;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\ninput:focus,\nselect:focus {\n  border-color: var(--primary);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.4);\n}\n\n.pixel-btn {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: var(--primary);\n  color: #fff;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.1s, background 0.1s;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\n.pixel-btn:hover {\n  background: #ff5c7a;\n}\n\n.pixel-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #fff;\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n.pixel-btn:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\n.result-area {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 12px;\n  background: var(--input-bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.result-label {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\n.result-value {\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--primary);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n.formulas {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: #a0a0b0;\n  border-top: 2px dashed var(--border);\n  padding-top: 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  body {\n    padding: 8px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n  }\n}\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const temperatureInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst directionSelect = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertButton = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convertTemperature() {\n  const raw = temperatureInput.value.trim();\n  const direction = directionSelect.value;\n\n  if (raw === '') {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const value = Number(raw);\n  if (!Number.isFinite(value)) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let converted;\n  if (direction === 'c-to-f') {\n    converted = value * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else if (direction === 'f-to-c') {\n    converted = (value - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  } else {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  resultOutput.textContent = converted.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertButton.addEventListener('click', convertTemperature);\n\ntemperatureInput.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {\n  if (event.key === 'Enter') {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    convertTemperature();\n  }\n});\n\nresultOutput.textContent = '--';\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA retro pixel-style temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Works fully offline.\n\n## Features\n\n- Convert Celsius to Fahrenheit or Fahrenheit to Celsius\n- Results shown with exactly two decimal places (no units)\n- Invalid or empty input displays `Error`\n- Keyboard accessible: press Enter in the input to convert\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a numeric temperature in the **Temperature** field.\n3. Choose a direction from the **Direction** dropdown.\n4. Click **Convert** (or press Enter).\n5. The result appears in the **Result** area.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — page structure\n- `style.css` — pixel-art theme and responsive layout\n- `script.js` — conversion logic and event handling\n\n## Notes\n\n- No external dependencies, network requests, or storage.\n- Uses system monospace fonts for a pixel-like feel.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
